er matters as per agenda of the Board Meeting.\r\n", "NEWSID": "220b22c7-24ae-4d37-a39f-e1fcd84e16b9", "NEWSSUB": "Board Meeting Intimation for Intimation Of Meeting Of The Board Of Directors Pursuant To Regulation 29 Of SEBI (Listing Obligations And Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015.", "NEWS_DT": "2026-11-05T16:19:23.57", "NSURL": "https://www.bseindia.com/stock-share-price/austere-systems-ltd/austere/544505/", "News_submission_dt": "2026-11-05T16:19:22", "OLD": 1, "PDFFLAG": 1, "QUARTER_ID": null, "RN": 1, "SCRIP_CD": 544505, "SLONGNAME": "Austere Systems Ltd", "SUBCATNAME": "Board Meeting", "TimeDiff": "00:00:01", "XML_NAME": "ANN_544505_220B22C7-24AE-4D37-A39F-E1FCD84E16B9"}]